   "in_a_case": false,
   "library": false,
   "on_a_board": true,
   "class": ""
  },
  {
   "text": "Default rows do not move. Categories pins its Default row to the top and keeps doing so under every sort; Pricing matrices never pinned theirs and still does not. The two lists stay deliberately different, because that is what production does today.",
   "where": "sources/design-2026-10-13-artifact/files/canvas.json:57",
   "in_a_case": false,
   "library": false,
   "on_a_board": true,
   "class": ""
  },
  {
